# Pier / raft / pontoon deck (one-way): a 5 px plank deck like
# tile_jetty's (o lip, O planks with l joints, l bottom) on a d stringer
# with short l/d cross-beam stubs; transparent below, so the water and the
# background show. Open ends (left/right) get end grain (o lit left, l
# right) and a pile with an l/d cap bracket: the 4 px O/l pile (cols 6-9)
# runs down to the tile bottom and continues in tile_steg_pfahl under it.
# Drawn by the pixel-artist with a throwaway script; the grids are the source.
# Autotiled (D-020): anim `auto`, frame = neighbour mask
# (1 = same tile above, 2 = right, 4 = below, 8 = left; level edge = same).
sprite = tile_steg
size   = 16x16
origin = 0,0
anim   = auto frames=16 ticks=1
---
